stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> ManifestKnown
  ManifestKnown --> EvidencePresented: negotiate accepted
  EvidencePresented --> Decided: compose + local policy
  Decided --> Active: ALLOW with validity window
  Active --> EvidencePresented: REVOKE_ECHO / recompute
  Active --> [*]: expires
  Decided --> [*]: DENY / ESCALATE / CONFLICT
